tdl v0.20.4 by iyear and contributors
https://github.com/iyear/tdl/releases/tag/v0.20.4

TG NestFetch runs a separately compiled tdl command-line utility. This build
is identified as 0.20.4-nestfetch.1, modified by TG NestFetch on 2026-11-23.
It uses gotd v0.165.1 and its Zap logging adapter for cross-DC QR sign-in.

tdl is distributed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.
This directory includes its LICENSE, the upstream source archive for commit
9d7d49eef2bcb04da720c26e33598c49c68b9ddd, and all changes in qr-login.patch.
After extracting the archive, run git apply --unidiff-zero /path/to/qr-login.patch
and go build -mod=readonly from its root. See scripts/prepare-tdl.mjs in the
TG NestFetch source for target selection and release version flags.
